		// The LastHitResult.ImpactPoint already reflects where the pointer struck the widget,
		// considering the pointer's actual dimensions.
		// However, when the impact occurs near the widget's edge, GetHitWidgetPath may fail
		// if the radius is exactly zero. To avoid this issue, we use a minimal positive radius.
		const float CursorRadius = 3.0f;
